%% BGP finite state machine (FSM)
flowchart LR
    Idle --> Connect
    Connect -->|"TCP ok"| OpenSent
    Connect -->|"failure"| Active
    Active -->|"TCP ok"| OpenSent
    Active -->|"retry"| Connect
    OpenSent -->|"OPEN received"| OpenConfirm
    OpenConfirm -->|"KEEPALIVE"| Established
    Established -->|"error / NOTIFICATION"| Idle
    OpenSent -->|"error"| Idle
    OpenConfirm -->|"error"| Idle
